              "credentials": {
                "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
                "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
              }
            }
          },
          "docs": "The Me API provides access to current user information, assigned records, and pending tasks.\nThis endpoint serves as the primary interface for user-specific data and personal workspace functionality.\n\n**Core Functionality**:\n- **User Profile** - Current user information including accounts and permissions\n- **Assigned Records** - All records assigned to the current user across different types\n- **Task Management** - Pending tasks assigned to the current user\n\n**User Context**:\n- All endpoints ret"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List pending tasks assigned to the current user",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://{account-domain}.aha.io/api/v1/api/v1/me/tasks",
